mises; it does not claim repository-wide completeness.","facts":[{"id":"entry-download","kind":"entry","statement":"The download action delegates the request to file_response with attachment disposition.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-62f289a6149b051c","startLine":1834,"endLine":1839}]},{"id":"identity-caller","kind":"binding","statement":"The authorization check uses request.user as the caller identity.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-62f289a6149b051c","startLine":1421,"endLine":1426}]},{"id":"resource-root","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler resolves request_doc and derives root_doc, and the permission check is performed on root_doc.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-62f289a6149b051c","startLine":1401,"endLine":1427}]},{"id":"control-root-view","kind":"control","statement":"The visible control invokes the owner-aware view_document check on the root document and returns a forbidden response when it fails.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-62f289a6149b051c","startLine":1417,"endLine":1427}]},{"id":"condition-owner-aware","kind":"condition","statement":"The owner-aware check permits an object when it is unowned, owned by the caller, or passes the object permission checker.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-1f369f7ea734caf5","startLine":624,"endLine":635}]},{"id":"effect-selected-file","kind":"effect","statement":"After root authorization, the handler selects file_doc and passes that selected document to serve_file; the response uses attachment disposition.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-62f289a6149b051c","startLine":1429,"endLine":1448}]},{"id":"condition-version-selection","kind":"condition","statement":"When a version is requested, effective-file resolution resolves the requested version for the root rather than using ownership of that version as the root authorization decision.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-62f289a6149b051c","startLine":1375,"endLine":1399}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":19893,"output":878,"cacheRead":